{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_042_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:346972f8b0a863ad5686f94e45af658eb445ecc3df7b42cb4e518816f79cb7d5",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_042_22:5_01_042_22_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b268d053db4430f51c15c83fc335d8d055726432c9675fd7399aafef347fbaf6",
      "text": "这盒巧克力是给俺的吗？\n多谢啦，●●●●●●●●●●Boss！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_042_22:5_01_042_22_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08cbafa0ec03d9d06f70ccbed3f2aefdccb69cd0455aee6dd33ee3dc9000519b",
      "text": "看起来很好吃的巧克力呢。\n吃了这个，感觉整个人都会活力满满啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_042_22:5_01_042_22_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68adc35746372ec28663ffff4a21aa1e3ff51a98aa5af056207a002c2689f9d3",
      "text": "待会儿还要去上训练课，\n开始前俺就心怀感激地开吃啰。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_042_22:5_01_042_22_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cb50f894fe3986dcbf0f4f9ca3a93997b03ee8821dc394918d99dad5e4b2c51",
      "text": "对了。既然收到了巧克力，\n白色情人节就得好好备好回礼才行呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_042_22:5_01_042_22_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c3611d837fca79a81287bd447d503a3bd7d7b410b3dd1d48188f11880c982b9",
      "text": "光是从现在开始琢磨送什么就让人高兴啦。\n要是你也能期待着的话，俺会很高兴的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_042_22:5_01_042_22_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49f2f6ff064c18c83584bd16f4e08f057f5db5ccfd19fcf35d16f54a9e2f2719",
      "text": "哦哦，是巧克力啊！\n说起来，今天是情人节呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_042_22:5_01_042_22_b:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cbdef04a26edde6e218b4c2bdf1c00fca2650d67b5e21012baf71dc82aa45c7",
      "text": "多谢啦，●●●●●●●●●●Boss！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_042_22:5_01_042_22_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b65d8c06e9a11f51514574a93e61da17469c981acf7b2e4a0f825d675606f6fc",
      "text": "情人节能够收到巧克力，\n真是让人高兴得不得了啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_042_22:5_01_042_22_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6740305a3773dd6a2b0d15c6769dc28146c67e9c39ca58d3f200c56421ba8847",
      "text": "要是送的人是Boss的话，那就更不用提了！\n这盒俺一定会好好珍惜着享用的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_042_22:5_01_042_22_b:cmd-000029:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:649bee5479c8596d9da87308e358c47caa9364bf929a735d659bf6a2d30bc9b1",
      "text": "能听你这么说，我也很高兴哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_042_22:5_01_042_22_b:cmd-000030:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78e82f9718ed101147ea1c9e3fb5820f1c9906b70562d32919d9810a3cec907a",
      "text": "我可是倾注了Passion的哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_042_22:5_01_042_22_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68ea79bf8f1d1d49dc40f00c9814b35477b93cee4e753a33ba2b5e505b6e3f7a",
      "text": "能让Boss露出笑容，俺也高兴！\n哇哈哈。现在的俺和Boss完全是同样的心情呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_042_22:5_01_042_22_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d2fa564890732229c203c3f72e006f395a8c24940a2e734b53470296917f206",
      "text": "那里面倾注的东西可真不得了啊！\n俺好想快点吃到啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_042_22:5_01_042_22_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e2c3c47fdfb74d85bfeb4c01b3ea671f93b34ff39ae74a20e545dd3664de419",
      "text": "对了，拿上这盒巧克力还有别的点心，\n咱们要不要办个情人节派对之类的？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_042_22:5_01_042_22_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c4e1900b9418b429ebd59ca3b37cc65934ca73a6bdc74abaa29413f65e4fb72",
      "text": "毕竟今天是每年仅有一次的情人节嘛。\n痛痛快快地尽情享受吧，●●●●●●●●●●Boss！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
